    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now put points given in option and then we get <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> as required answer.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
